    "Write a python function count_bits(n) that counts set bits in n",
    "Write a python function reverse_bits(n) that reverses bits of a 32-bit integer",
    "Write a python function single_number(lst) that finds the element appearing once",
    "Write a python function missing_number(lst) that finds missing number in 0 to n",
    "Write a python function hamming_weight(n) that returns number of 1 bits",
    "Write a python function power_of_two(n) that returns True if n is a power of 2",
    "Write a python function power_of_three(n) that returns True if n is a power of 3",
    "Write a python function sum_of_two_integers(a, b) that adds without + operator",
    "Write a python function bitwise_and_range(m, n) that returns bitwise AND of range m to n",
    "Write a python function gray_code(n) that returns gray code sequence of length 2^n",
    "Write a python function fraction_to_decimal(num, den) that converts fraction to decimal string",
    "Write a python function excel_column(n) that converts number to excel column title",
    "Write a python function excel_column_number(s) that converts excel column title to number",
    "Write a python function happy_number(n) that returns True if n is a happy number",
    "Write a python function ugly_number(n) that returns True if n is an ugly number",
    "Write a python function nth_ugly(n) that returns the nth ugly number",
    "Write a python function count_primes(n) that counts primes less than n",
    "Write a python function reverse_integer(x) that reverses digits of integer",
    "Write a python function palindrome_number(x) that checks if integer is palindrome",
    "Write a python function trailing_zeros(n) that counts trailing zeros in n factorial"
